    "detailed_description": "<strong>The adventure of the Lonely Knight begins.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/81bae3835fbf3c60b32cbd2894a79389.avif?t=1752659198\" width=524 height=214 /></span><br><br>Lonely Knight is a game that combines idle and roguelike elements.<br><br>Defeat monsters and search for companions for the lonely knight.<br><br>Grow while idle and test your strength in dungeons!<br><br><br><strong>Embark on an Adventure!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/b19ceb4872de00194f8728a98b634235.avif?t=1752659198\" width=240 height=442 /></span><br>Lonely Knight features 7 fields, 3 event fields, 28 levels of difficulty,<br>and an infinite dungeon waiting for you.<br><br><br><strong>Strategic Roguelike with 3 Choices</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/6cbef6a8e1a98bb637e8584371b092be.avif?t=1752659198\" width=300 height=416 /></span><br>Create your own deck. Oh, luck is essential!<br><br><br><strong>Various Grades of Skills</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/731efefc9a52eac74da0cb254934b2ad.avif?t=1752659198\" width=514 height=320 /></span><br>There are a wide variety of skills available.<br>Build your own deck and start the battle!<br><br><br><strong>Mastery System</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/98e4d5da831913537a7f7c5585a3d794.avif?t=1752659198\" width=240 height=442 /></span><br>Create a hero with unique characteristics like no other!<br><br><br><strong>Terrifying Bosses</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/c6362648e0d3fe84e520596b22f40567.poster.avif?t=1752659198\" width=396 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/c6362648e0d3fe84e520596b22f40567.webm?t=1752659198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/c6362648e0d3fe84e520596b22f40567.mp4?t=1752659198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge dungeons, defeat bosses, and acquire their powers!!<br>Of course, it won't be easy...<br><br><br>*Recommended for:<br><br>- Those who want to experience the endless joy of growth<br>- Fans of roguelike games<br>- Those who enjoy light deck-building games<br>- Those who can't spend a lot of time on games<br>-Those who don't have much time but want to enjoy games<br><br><br>*Languages:<br><br>Korean<br>Japanese<br>English",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The adventure of the Lonely Knight begins.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/81bae3835fbf3c60b32cbd2894a79389.avif?t=1752659198\" width=524 height=214 /></span><br><br>Lonely Knight is a game that combines idle and roguelike elements.<br><br>Defeat monsters and search for companions for the lonely knight.<br><br>Grow while idle and test your strength in dungeons!<br><br><br><strong>Embark on an Adventure!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/b19ceb4872de00194f8728a98b634235.avif?t=1752659198\" width=240 height=442 /></span><br>Lonely Knight features 7 fields, 3 event fields, 28 levels of difficulty,<br>and an infinite dungeon waiting for you.<br><br><br><strong>Strategic Roguelike with 3 Choices</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/6cbef6a8e1a98bb637e8584371b092be.avif?t=1752659198\" width=300 height=416 /></span><br>Create your own deck. Oh, luck is essential!<br><br><br><strong>Various Grades of Skills</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/731efefc9a52eac74da0cb254934b2ad.avif?t=1752659198\" width=514 height=320 /></span><br>There are a wide variety of skills available.<br>Build your own deck and start the battle!<br><br><br><strong>Mastery System</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/98e4d5da831913537a7f7c5585a3d794.avif?t=1752659198\" width=240 height=442 /></span><br>Create a hero with unique characteristics like no other!<br><br><br><strong>Terrifying Bosses</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/c6362648e0d3fe84e520596b22f40567.poster.avif?t=1752659198\" width=396 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/c6362648e0d3fe84e520596b22f40567.webm?t=1752659198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757630/extras/c6362648e0d3fe84e520596b22f40567.mp4?t=1752659198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge dungeons, defeat bosses, and acquire their powers!!<br>Of course, it won't be easy...<br><br><br>*Recommended for:<br><br>- Those who want to experience the endless joy of growth<br>- Fans of roguelike games<br>- Those who enjoy light deck-building games<br>- Those who can't spend a lot of time on games<br>-Those who don't have much time but want to enjoy games<br><br><br>*Languages:<br><br>Korean<br>Japanese<br>English",
